  "html": "<p><b>Some of the most valued rainbow items are Growth Items, those that have a \"+ % Character Size\" attribute.  The attribute seems to apply to character height, and those mathematicians familiar with the square/cube law will realize that it gives a much greater effect to overall character mass and appearance.  Although the increased character size gives absolutely no advantage whatsoever in combat, it is a great vanity boost for some players and usually a Growth Item can be traded very well.  Here is a list of some of the known Growth Items in the game.  It appears that the maximum growth is 56%, being two rings at 13% each and an amulet at 26%.</b>\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:251px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Growth.jpg\" title=\"Example of 23% growth effect\"><img alt=\"Example of 23% growth effect\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"285\" src=\"/images/Growth.jpg\" width=\"249\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Growth.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Example of 23% growth effect</div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:277px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Growth56.jpg\" title=\"Example of 56% growth effect\"><img alt=\"Example of 56% growth effect\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"267\" src=\"/images/Growth56.jpg\" width=\"275\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Growth56.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Example of 56% growth effect</div></div></div>\n</td></tr></table>\n\n<div id=\"mw-pages\">\n<h2>Articles in category \"Growth Items\"</h2>\n<p>There are 13 articles in this category.\n</p><table width=\"100%\"><tr valign=\"top\"><td>\n<h3>A</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Amulet_of_Yawn-Bore\" title=\"Amulet of Yawn-Bore\">Amulet of Yawn-Bore</a></li></ul>\n<h3>C</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Circus_Ring\" title=\"Circus Ring\">Circus Ring</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Country_Fried_Amulet\" title=\"Country Fried Amulet\">Country Fried Amulet</a></li></ul>\n<h3>D</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Duality_of_Man\" title=\"Duality of Man\">Duality of Man</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>F</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Fragtastic_Finger_Bracelet\" title=\"Fragtastic Finger Bracelet\">Fragtastic Finger Bracelet</a></li></ul>\n<h3>H</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Hoof_Loop\" title=\"Hoof Loop\">Hoof Loop</a></li></ul>\n<h3>M</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Mad_Bling\" title=\"Mad Bling\">Mad Bling</a></li></ul>\n<h3>T</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Found_One\" title=\"The Found One\">The Found One</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Lost_One\" title=\"The Lost One\">The Lost One</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td>\n<h3>T cont.</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_Most_Amazing_Ring_Known_to_Goats\" title=\"The Most Amazing Ring Known to Goats\">The Most Amazing Ring Known to Goats</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/The_One_True_Bling\" title=\"The One True Bling\">The One True Bling</a></li></ul>\n<h3>U</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Uber-Most_Amulet_of_the_Dreaded_Dragonfly\" title=\"Uber-Most Amulet of the Dreaded Dragonfly\">Uber-Most Amulet of the Dreaded Dragonfly</a></li></ul>\n<h3>W</h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Wring\" title=\"Wring\">Wring</a></li></ul>\n</td>\n</tr></table>\n</div>\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
